'' A name nothing declared is fbc's error 42 wherever a value is read or written -- 24 errors
'' on fbc-modern 1.20 and 1.10.1 alike, on exactly these lines and naming exactly these
'' names (2026-09-19), and 'procptr' of one (line 35) is error 8. One per statement: line
'' 38 names 'a' and not 'b' or 'c', line 39 'zz21' and not 'zz22'. Everything from line 53
'' on is accepted by both and must stay so: builtins and fbc's runtime bind no symbol,
'' and an 'assert' argument, an '#assert' operand, 'offsetof''s field, an OPEN device and
'' an explicit enum's sibling are not values the program reads. Each of those seven lines
'' drew TKO0743 before its exclusion.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -fmax-errors 100 --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/undeclared-name.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 25
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(12,1): error TKO0743: 'zz1' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(13,5): error TKO0743: 'zz2' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(14,7): error TKO0743: 'zz3' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(15,5): error TKO0743: 'zz4' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(16,1): error TKO0743: 'zz5' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(17,1): error TKO0743: 'zz6' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(18,13): error TKO0743: 'zz7' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(19,20): error TKO0743: 'zz8' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(20,5): error TKO0743: 'zz9' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(21,6): error TKO0743: 'zz10' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(23,6): error TKO0743: 'zz11' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(24,10): error TKO0743: 'zz12' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(25,1): error TKO0743: 'zz13' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(26,10): error TKO0743: 'zz14' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(27,10): error TKO0743: 'zz15' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(28,11): error TKO0743: 'zz16' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(30,10): error TKO0743: 'zz17' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(32,10): error TKO0743: 'zz18' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(33,8): error TKO0743: 'zz19' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(34,6): error TKO0743: 'zz20' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(35,30): error TKO0783: 'zzp' is not declared, so 'procptr' has no procedure to take
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(38,1): error TKO0743: 'a' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: undeclared-name.bas(39,7): error TKO0743: 'zz21' is not declared
